  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Exploring Quran Data Sources**\n\nI\'m now investigating potential open-source Quran Uthmani data sources, specifically focusing on GitHub, Tanzil, and the Quran.com API. My focus is on testing the viability of various open-source Quran JSON repositories, starting with a GitHub repository. I\'m leveraging Node v22.23.3 with its native `fetch` capabilities.\n\n\n**Verifying JSON Schema & Data**\n\nI\'m currently validating the data schema against my requirements, focusing on Uthmani text. I\'ve examined several sources: the Al Quran Cloud API, raw GitHub content, and the Tanzil project directly. I\'m confirming each ayah structure, specifically \"sura,\" \"aya,\" and \"text\" fields, alongside the requested Uthmani text. I\'m running tests to verify the schema matches the example provided.\n\n\n"
