    summary: "The `risan/quran-json` GitHub repository provides Quran text and translations in JSON format[1]. You can access the raw JSON files directly through the GitHub repository or via content delivery networks (CDNs).\n\nTo find the raw JSON files:\n\n*   **GitHub Repository**: Navigate to the `risan/quran-json` repository on GitHub. Within the repository, you\'ll typically find a `json` directory or similar that contains the individual JSON files for each surah (chapter)[2][3].\n*   **UNPKG CDN**: You can access individual surah JSON files directly through UNPKG. For example, to view the raw JSON for Surah 94, you could use a URL similar to `https://unpkg.com/quran-json/dist/chapters/94.json`[4].\n*   **jsDelivr CDN**: jsDelivr also hosts the `quran-json` package, providing another option to access the raw data[5].\n\nSources:\n[1] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQESoDICnO6ZiCOiUfm5QU01AnNm0J41-AI4Bkwj732oJxqnwQXMUyLP441oC1WBf-PdV1W6hiR6AaxV_1fPP8l9wq9CBpH-esVieUWCYIhIApNiBahiQqCPrx8ob5LU)\n[2] [unpkg.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFgE4rLQT1l1vOFUbNhFmJyYS84ZfaAIASRW5OmSyN6NY0lUkAoKN9vgYsRMWiP0S1p4sU8tHdJ6o8E64jaVAsBmU9LOjOs7oIYHhMidCyKess6kNc74fIxXyt4_m4Uj5Cz2wDQ5j3Hy-0SU9G7L4vyQg==)\n[3] [unpkg.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGZIzZEwsMoR62B_ET44z9ZlwgOKcxDv-lyZLMD4TYSCd_o7e7dBUYQjsNqkC7yw6V53wa67aNOyOfmnHzkL_bvT6fcLHSYQZKYzI9A1MHbekXE6O2bwGwz-WOrcYjzlNO5oJJf9x46jMA7EYo=)\n[4] [unpkg.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFPcGaMUdJz-vXCE-2lO7IGTSerEC3oLTP6R-2pElkS9sI0sHU3BN5_RwxnGxBTZjXIiPGEf33CZ2V9_M6EzFRE5Qi6Ldkyk1cT7F-vNNJlfo1ExtL28o4Z04C6gB77NXWqXOXpOar1SQ0yrl4zU5KQIFc0YUmJ0amJaBP42Q==)\n[5] [jsdelivr.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHQFloJKp1FRRnKkcT_yvPP_7udjNEalszRgKgO8kD0E1T2erg81BLb5k1iIIDSpEYEq0-O76aUPXwygmWDnLUTmy9MMzzMBIDmHr7PzeUIBezhoq54tchxwydertMt9is2IVmmoVPjBQmU)"
