    thinking: "**Defining Core Components**\n\nI\'m currently focused on defining the core data structures. Right now, I\'m working on the `src/types/quran.ts` file. I\'m thinking of these structs: `Ayah` with `{ sura: number; aya: number; text: string }` and `SurahMeta` with `{ id: number; name: string }`.\n\n\n**Expanding Data Structures**\n\nI\'ve expanded the `SurahMeta` structure to include `transliteration`, `type` (meccan/medinan), and `total_verses`. I\'m also creating a `SurahWithVerses` type, which combines `SurahMeta` and an array of `Ayah` objects. I\'m focusing on utility functions now, including Arabic numeral conversion and a diacritic remover to improve search flexibility. Then I have audio URL generation. I\'ve drafted components for the top bar and the Surah sidebar. Lastly, I\'m defining the reader view components.\n\n\n"
