  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing the Arabic Font Request**\n\nI\'m currently dissecting this Arabic font request. My focus is on understanding the value of incorporating this specific font (\"Osmani\" script, high quality) into the application. Before making any changes, I\'m trying to figure out what benefits it would provide to the application. I\'m looking for the user\'s intended value of the font.\n\n\n**Evaluating Font Integration**\n\nI\'ve moved on to assessing the technical implementation. The user needs the KFGQPC Uthman Taha Naskh font integrated, so I\'m determining how to add the .ttf file to the app\'s font folder (e.g., assets/fonts). Now I\'m focused on the proper configuration within project settings like pubspec.yaml (Flutter) or build.gradle/Info.plist (React Native/Mobile Native) to ensure the font loads correctly across all screens.\n\n\n**Justifying the Font\'s Necessity**\n\nI\'ve realized the critical importance of this font request for an authentic Quran application. Standard fonts lack support for crucial Osmani script glyphs like the dagger-alif, specific pause marks, the prostration symbol, and complex vowel diacritics. The specified \"KFGQPC Uthman Taha Naskh\" is the officially approved font aligned with the Madinah Mushaf, ensuring perfect phonetic and orthographic accuracy without rendering issues.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_138435"
