      title: "aboutcode.org"
    }
    summary: "Several GitHub repositories contain \"Uthmanic\" and \"Hafs\" fonts, often in TTF or OTF formats.\n\nOne repository, \"raflyfahrezi/KFGQPC-Uthmanic-Script-HAFS-Regular,\" directly offers the \"KFGQPC Uthmanic Script HAFS Regular Fonts\".[1]\n\nAnother significant source is \"quranwbw/qpc-fonts,\" which provides various Mushaf fonts, including \"Uthman Hafs.\"[2] This repository indicates that the fonts can be retrieved from `http://qurancomplex.gov.sa/TTF/` or `http://fonts.qurancomplex.gov.sa`.[2] It also shows examples of `@font-face` declarations using WOFF2 and WOFF formats, but the original source also provides TTF.[2]\n\nAdditionally, the \"thetruetruth/quran-data-kfgqpc\" repository includes Quran Unicode Uthmanic Font Data from KFGQPC, and within this, there are references to `hafssmart.8.ttf` and `hafs.18.ttf` files, among others.[3]\n\nIt\'s important to note that the \"Uthmanic Script License\" states that the font is the property of King Fahd Glorious Quran Printing Complex and may not be reproduced or modified without their express written approval.[4]\n\nSources:\n[1] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFpZCkiLl5AzCgpHM-yQWeaiSsn3gtRPxs6I1V3VXfrUGQGZCjibrt55-bwj6CDwKgbIQG6EZqkEfhWKr5gzOA_FuiLTgR2wjT72_dm0bU9vgb9drqBzTytz7MNqh3OJdBADLrI8O-9EoWVKLP7lgqfv-lMRITN1IrIPQ5aumM=)\n[2] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGN1rGtOgXS9i7EbKJ1kKcGBqehpjUD1cxuJfIZGGJ8TJ1fHcs_j3J2cVNlDX3cC0UQo8joXjeosaj3WUwUA4FjyeD1oAIKKYdXH8bo8yxWOw-1OBCJu62kowIhcasUVC4=)\n[3] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHiLDm954Jb-40pQr4JdYB3ImOHrPREQ_L10zIUfpeLZaQZ2PlPWzKFa5esVIJ0UlK9jwX3f5uuBCZBThlenBF2Ig4AWVm3ZMC1aEmH5xeI3ll_4PqAEtXhZCryWfIwuX6hwrMF3UWeazfXf20=)\n[4] [aboutcode.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHkLNiZulkVBNpQkH7ulit14XwzoGHqcxD54XiovJFyJSjwckqOEMGASA_F9Xj8-aTaWL79pDfmP4mZQyQL55i8dyh