      url: "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHoMWs2aIuLmyhLS5NGESInnq9Mf_ECZbHuqlCEJKFY7fr9FxZx5HFPtlCzMqQpGcgsF7i85hTKDRGVKuwg0g4qoVe-yQHrkMzMhtfjSYF2byweIdo-k3pO0D42MU6QmWcoXxVU-xadWVgb2phAFqldkhAbjNGhuWV3DYId4HwLpkb3ne5qUnRqkLu4tjewsZyo"
      title: "stackoverflow.com"
    }
    summary: "You can find the \"Uthman Taha Naskh\" font, including the \"UthmanTahaNaskh.ttf\" file and related versions, through several sources, particularly on GitHub.\n\nHere\'s a summary of findings:\n*   A direct download for \"UthmanTahaNaskh.ttf\" (Version 0.08) is available, noted as copyrighted by King Fahd Glorious Quran Printing Complex[1].\n*   Various GitHub repositories host versions of the \"KFGQPC Uthman Taha Naskh\" font:\n    *   A GitHub issue in `vladpopa33/googlefontdirectory` from 2015 discusses \"KFGQPC Uthman Taha Naskh\" and links to `UthmanTN1 Ver10.otf`[2].\n    *   The `fawazahmed0/quran-api` GitHub repository includes \"KFGQPC Uthman Taha Naskh Regular\" (Version 0.06) and \"KFGQPC Uthman Taha Naskh Bold\" (Version 0.1), with original `.otf` file links like `uthman-tn1-ver06-org.otf` and `uthman-tn1-b-ver10-org.otf`[3].\n    *   The `vdemir/zekr` GitHub repository mentions that \"KFGQPC Uthman Taha Naskh (UthmanTN1 Ver10.otf and UthmanTN1B Ver10.otf)\" is built based on Uthman Taha calligraphy by the King Fahd Glorious Quran Printing Complex[4].\n    *   The `quranwbw/qpc-fonts` GitHub repository provides font-face declarations with URLs to `woff2` and `woff` formats of \"Uthman Naskh\" (including `UthmanTN1 Ver10.woff2` and `UthmanTN1B Ver10.woff2`)[5].\n    *   Another repository, `Recite-Quran/ReciteQuran`, offers guidance on integrating KFGQPC Uthman Taha Naskh as Uthmanic Fonts[6].\n*   The \"UthmanTahaNaskh.ttf\" file has been used in examples for rendering Arabic text in `pdfMake`[7].\n\nSources:\n[1] [urdufont.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFZicPxKJLSSD3Aq9TYNrZsWc30I1_93NRIJqe8GPTp_paNSeDLXvnXHO3Cz5lqJJ4BbgjFAr6qvIs01SIRwp0B7jthy0Xsy-p1em8C7GQVLjmw_c-qcReRK3t2O6UoYEdBCelg8yXbR3_D)\n[2] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFm9bsJbip-wJXiw8tiOLDeIQ23qPrrk0_cugAynIkMWA-jPXoq5-9EqWEODaPLMM0u7i0_wn32bm4_btflGZCVpjE8lIw0tGJQFJavF-uXY63Z_HCKRxbtKaSW3_jVTrpH0YyjSN-HdEn02qKWit8dnYutv6EpMw==)\n[3] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFCEybrBunhYnkCWo9vG-_qQjhgjfoY9U8DJyBy1Gs624dxJ2KcHNXK_WsMjeHdsRKpceoG9Ac-iJbcSKPkVAXwKDkLVHcb_Zt1YZ_LecxJsqUs2GhGSaHF4ElFp94HYQf0IMGC7IXIMviW5f8p3rBiMapnfGKTBeGA)\n[4] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFwVP5YpKU6qS2bIu8hG4vGMe9zPYRrk5OOLK-HPd1lFmytVNJvE7xlldjHx85j7vANpvvt8ydz6e0665IB7lJv7MuDNctjEjHmiRkI0SxRuo9QsN05_m8ZTosSmjOSzYkgsiaetLE-sXkfDx-bPY4=)\n[5] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFC0VOAU_E72N9kQKdykRxiHNn6v9LyhtTVZOoMyN8DpTCusJ5UaUU8-SSPvRySSQ4QPw5ptjA_NDdJxhc7wo44jHzkYKMYL5co3uorU_b0qz4zrNPZGdsgS2lAjGwzYyQ=)\n[6] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE14uIGjelIJ5S88h5O_eMiEoXjFDt6_mg_DX9-f-ZHKO-lCEoRwykD5ot9loPi0pXsIuOagdaod7Socz2BsmDWe7Vf4R0_e47aTSjV9uxAmM_LBR1z_ePA43VRDzjvT_bafbte)\n[7] [stackoverflow.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHoMWs2aIuLmyhLS5NGESInnq9Mf_ECZbHuqlCEJKFY7fr9FxZx5HFPtlCzMqQpGcgsF7i85hTKDRGVKuwg0g4qoVe-yQHrkMzMhtfjSYF2byweIdo-k3pO0D42MU6QmWcoXxVU-xadWVgb2phAFqldkhAbjNGhuWV3DYId4HwLpkb3ne5qUnRqkLu4tjewsZyo)"
