    summary: "A search on GitHub for \"UthmanTN1\" or \"UthmanTN1 Ver10.otf\" reveals several relevant results. One significant finding is a file named `UthmanTN1 Ver10.otf` located within the `Furqan` repository, specifically at `Furqan/src/main/resources/themes/standard/fonts/UthmanTN1 Ver10.otf`. This repository is described as an \"Open Source Adobe AIR Quran application using \'Qurani\' API. With Uthmani font embedded.\"[1].\n\nThe font \"UthmanTN1-Ver10\" is identified as a classic Quranic font, based on the Hafs an \'Asim recitation, and is available in OTF format[2]. It is also mentioned in discussions regarding installing Arabic fonts, where `UthmanTN1 Ver10.otf` is noted to contain TrueType font data, suggesting it could potentially be renamed with a `.ttf` extension[3][4]. Additionally, a website called OnlineWebFonts.COM offers \"UthmanTN1 otf Fonts Free Downloads\"[5]. The font is also part of the resources for the \"Munajatk\" project, which provides open-source assets like fonts and databases for Quranic applications[2].\n\nSources:\n[1] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFIWpoQNJXUkYQUZdhPb_hgwM-KA0w1Uw6BdXscBe_wC6CU7ylFE7rbdau9e1eObYUjGK4sskzPyGVEMdcpKAg9tqZsJ9g5eLKAFIgvqUHg8dxFKQ3PwxsclzaCcXiTh6axVTTMPH1dWLykQT60Oooz_ptW9oGfJc-wgHRuAqOp-qW037ZFaQlui5pVw71gABnr_ZBDbwkEpvAifp4UAeOvMG_7svpoSA==)\n[2] [monaajatak.app](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQESt4IndP6x9oTAx3KomEhPXnwx2ldYtWgljWV-UjHc8xYfXuJdow7xEYDqDO2X777_fsLSlVqr1BPxDFqynUnIRmG5XQeVYLLzgV2VcBKUN7YwyRtQ5pSZENQVmaTc)\n[3] [ntg.nl](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFUgru2oRTt3Aj9z_8lzog3NENSdbBHJ8YgNK5kqgZESSu4a0q2kIKVuzIJiASclvu8xkGMGylk1fCTFiCFzXzxkK0Q5M0h6DhQLPabh5mXpWDSVjFHTqGN6IQN4heIHy5dkE5FgeDvAb-393eAxyDRyw2AQ427J2S_PPG6yig895tJlCS_VNSH2EympAHhFk32xSq8LmdHl4VM5TOpVWDecTlCD8sC)\n[4] [askubuntu.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFRwLf