    web_documents {
      url: "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEaW8CKf5HXJSijFh6b9GOvLYk9FU989rNHbK2CAfW4skbojPgT5MepEpqUdcv00BDT66Fyrn66w6pKvql0_RQ9ERs_vq3hEDftITm6elBng1GdN16QkBe15_P6TaT9THUoiy7AnM9hD5Xouuw-gQnmsvVZm8HNOw=="
      title: "github.com"
    }
    web_documents {
      url: "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHoirRbmp0d9YZv27cCIIOj7a_WDPTWuqdmbKWlUhtEuwSbA9eJ5tIm0B1m8yGf6J3gzaMTe-5M5Mr9T_YX5PXjHKkd1jQKTk1_0Q-Qi9vLBGcox40EFgFM_jxrAM-d2c1Q-Pi3"
      title: "github.com"
    }
    summary: "\"KFGQPC Uthman Taha Naskh\" refers to a font based on the calligraphy of Uthman Taha, developed by the King Fahd Glorious Quran Printing Complex[1]. This font is frequently found on GitHub in projects related to the Quran.\n\nSeveral GitHub repositories utilize or reference this font:\n*   The `fawazahmed0/quran-api` repository includes \"KFGQPC Uthman Taha Naskh\" in its `fonts.min.json` file, providing links to the original `.otf` and `.eot` font files for both regular and bold versions[2].\n*   The `quranwbw/qpc-fonts` repository contains CSS `@font-face` rules for \"Uthman Naskh,\" which locally references \"KFGQPC Uthman Taha Naskh\" and links to `.woff2` and `.woff` font files[3].\n*   An issue was opened in 2015 on the `vladpopa33/googlefontdirectory` GitHub repository concerning the \"KFGQPC Uthman Taha Naskh\" font, including an attachment of the `UthmanTN1 Ver10.otf` file[4].\n*   The `Recite-Quran/ReciteQuran` project also mentions guidance on integrating KFGQPC Uthman Taha Naskh[5].\n\nSources:\n[1] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGbvqX52eULDlgGF16Mnh5IV2Mt3PfPJ1Fw3Cl2gI9aoPxRDtZgtpW6_b_ET8mSAiAXSLZMOt_8T0PMh5_0H_bw-TZe8roWbdjhgVV7cXWiyB7OgLPWaNVHzPtNg6IfKkaRYFGEQui43x7ZcOb3GRg=)\n[2] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHtUutTKjN37dwalZ-P_I19e2RBPqx7H9edFQYP51qsq8ZwLLash5lEmfl6-Cqo__wNLiX2QIe2oEamEKYV7qBnW7t0nCvivkzRagYpQ7gBp8dzmQp4O9idmrJ3MZ9GIQzcoORK2LywviVQbD2T37VeG38VlUdbYQsI)\n[3] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFA7fJWy4pcv9sZiXQEhUGjkjRiajmjR2u0aHzmxqXb--rgjZLaDAVj2ziJ715C2N2Zg3ZkD2sa85ciX2uEEiVyLfrPcyIuQlyebwOY0M_CuwpI_Svjv_1DCtm6b4rUhnI=)\n[4] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEaW8CKf5HXJSijFh6b9GOvLYk9FU989rNHbK2CAfW4skbojPgT5MepEpqUdcv00BDT66Fyrn66w6pKvql0_RQ9ERs_vq3hEDftITm6elBng1GdN16QkBe15_P6TaT9THUoiy7AnM9hD5Xouuw-gQnmsvVZm8HNOw==)\n[5] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHoirRbmp0d9YZv27cCIIOj7a_WDPTWuqdmbKWlUhtEuwSbA9eJ5tIm0B1m8yGf6J3gzaMTe-5M5Mr9T_YX5PXjHKkd1jQKTk1_0Q-Qi9vLBGcox40EFgFM_jxrAM-d2c1Q-Pi3)"
